<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Petroleum says has 10.5 pct of Frontier.</title>
<headline>NZ Petroleum says has 10.5 pct of Frontier.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Petroleum said on Tuesday it had become a substantial security holder in Australian minor oil and gas company Frontier Petroleum, holding 10.48 percent of its ordinary shares.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4714 272</p>
<p>e-mail wellington.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
